        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forces of Nature</strong><br>Rediscover the wild in this retro hero defense game! After decades of decay under the watch of the rusted robot Army, nature is fighting back. Enter Sprout—a courageous guardian planted in the wastelands to reclaim the land and restore the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own army of diverse plants and unleash them against relentless robot hordes. Strategically manage your water resources and time your attacks for maximum effect. Sprout isn’t defenseless—take direct control to dodge, strike, and unleash powerful special abilities to turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of unique plants, refine your strategy, and reclaim the wasteland. Once you’ve driven the robots away, challenge yourself and others on global leaderboards to achieve the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring original hand-drawn art and design by award-winning artist Aaron Bonkowski, Forces of Nature delivers a simple yet challenging experience. Originally released on iOS in 2013, now modernized and enhanced for Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro hero defense gameplay with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique plant abilities and tactical resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct control of Sprout for dynamic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art from Aaron Bonkowski</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on global leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
